<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants continue to conduct lethal attacks in the Kenya-Somalia border area, killing two National Police Reservists and five civilian construction workers in an ambush on the Arabia-Lafey road and targeting a security escort vehicle nearby. Somali Danab commandos have launched security operations in Middle Shabelle to dismantle Al-Shabaab extortion networks. US forces carried out overnight airstrikes against ISIS positions in Puntland, Somalia. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQdk1XU216eUFxRzdTN0dUMl9tejJwcEhMMUNaZ0NEUFkybGN4cWQ2blY4VjREakhMVnJhY3hCdUZzdEN3TDV1cENrTmY0Z25TM1NTVHY0Z0VoU2dBV0ZNaGxVUTlsRFRwaTVXM3BFSmhuNnA2LTY0UUV3QVE3V0NOSXZ1TmdXcGYwSkxTSjVaeHY1S21zVW5WU19MOFE5Vmg5dkdUcFZaUXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNN1VpOXM4UGNzazlJLWY5TnIxVmgtLXd6NVlVb3JxREJoRkpoaFlXcUxWaVRRamM0ZVlhX0JmOVJXcnpWbGtXQ0dFcVd5Q1l2LTVMTzJESFhuR2ZkSkZKWlpnRTVqWTNGX05hWWN4Y2szVUlRWkF4cWtBNDk1aU9hTFhETVR1VmF1cllSSEhFTWw0elpHRkoxLTE5Ymx0OGVpbnQ3dDBxZ1hKaG42MTEwVkJXXzFqLVZFSWtndm9vaDZOUXBuOFFGZjJoQVM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOb3JyUzNhdWRjdHhnT3hxdnVFYWJOWWtpZW9ROU82SXRrQlJLQTQ1SXBTQnpmeW4yOEV4ZEx4SzZYUGRWOFFQSUlyVGt2d2FENUpSeGZKUWNBeEp5RXNfVUxvM3pONVV3eE1zeXhEd05EclBJRWZibWdodDJpYlkwVnJfN0hMN1hydGcxVS1tTkl4QTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star, Kenya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPWmwxTGNUM0RORHBNeDZUTUY0YWpCczhpVWNuVjJnN01KcDBpZ1ZyT0FUU2x1bmlBT2pBOEc1dkdJbFZvTHBZNXZDRTExWkhBU2N3a2w0VVlZc3N5SFNxamswYUZSbWtldGUtclBKcGRmcXNwUUZyQXlGNm9nYm9vUUZDbWE4ODBGUDM1Z25qbER5TGpIRlNCVGhuT2VDcEtkdUx0Y0Y1aTExeXIwd1JqTmx